---
import { RESUME, GITHUB, LINKEDIN, EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <h2 id="about-h" data-reveal>About</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I'm in the B.C.S. Honours program at Carleton University, in the AI and Machine Learning stream, and I expect to graduate in May 2028.</p>
      <p>Since May 2026 I've been a QA automation developer at the Department of National Defence. I work on a C# framework that turns recorded interaction data into Excel-driven Selenium tests, and I wrote the spec for its debug mode: a failed run pauses, you fix the test steps in the spreadsheet, and it resumes from the last passing step. From January to April 2026 I was an IP network engineering intern at Nokia, writing Python and Tcl regression suites for protocol state machines.</p>
      <p>Outside work and classes I build games and the C++ underneath them. The projects on this page are personal projects.</p>
      <p class="about__contact">The fastest way to reach me is email: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. My <a href={RESUME}>résumé is a PDF</a>, my code is on <a href={GITHUB}>GitHub</a>, and my work history is on <a href={LINKEDIN}>LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .about__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem); align-items: start; }
  .about__contact { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.4; }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) { .about__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  .about__contact a { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
